---
/**
 * [01] WHY IT EXISTS (CONTENT.md). §4: paragraphs reveal line by line.
 */
import Display from '../Display.astro';
import SectionHead from '../SectionHead.astro';
---

<section class="why section" id="why" aria-labelledby="why-title">
  <div class="container">
    <SectionHead
      label="[01] WHY IT EXISTS"
      fig="FIG. 01"
      path="README.md"
      anchor="What it does"
    />

    <div class="why__title breakout">
      <Display
        as="h2"
        id="why-title"
        reveal="up"
        lines={["A screenshot can't", 'answer back.']}
      />
    </div>

    <div class="why__grid grid">
      <div class="why__body">
        <p class="why__para" data-reveal="lines">
          Design reviews usually happen around a picture of the model: a slide, a screen
          share, a PNG in a chat. Someone asks what's behind that bracket and the answer is
          "I'll check."
        </p>

        <p class="why__para" data-reveal="lines">
          Viewpoint Arena puts the model itself in the room. Everyone has it open, in a
          browser, in 3D. You point at the part you mean and everyone sees which one. You
          can follow the person talking, or wander off and come back.
        </p>

        <p class="why__para" data-reveal="lines">
          What gets said doesn't vanish when the call ends. The meeting is transcribed and
          turned into cards (risks, actions with an owner and a date, and the reasons
          behind decisions) that you approve, edit or throw away.
        </p>

        <p class="why__note">
          IT RUNS ON ONE MACHINE YOU CONTROL. A DEFAULT INSTALL SENDS NOTHING OFF IT.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .why__title {
    padding-block-start: var(--sp-32);
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .why__grid {
    padding-block-start: var(--sp-48);
  }

  /* §1: body copy sits beside the big type, in 5–6 columns */
  .why__body {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--sp-24);
    min-width: 0;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .why__body {
      grid-column: 2 / span 6;
    }
  }

  .why__para {
    color: var(--ink-2);
    max-width: var(--measure);
  }

  .why__note {
    margin: 0;
    padding-block-start: var(--sp-16);
    border-block-start: var(--hairline) solid var(--rule);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--t-mono);
    font-weight: var(--t-mono-wght);
    letter-spacing: var(--t-mono-ls);
    line-height: var(--t-mono-lh);
    color: var(--ink);
    max-width: 34ch;
  }
</style>
